{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADSWITCH COMBAT</strong> is an action packed 2D multiplayer shooter that builds upon the previous games.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RANKED PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/662c27aa7974665d51348fc79cfc60e5.avif?t=1773980087\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Progress through the ranks</strong> by earning XP in-game by killing enemies, scoring objectives, and completing challenges. Unlock new weapons, attachments, equipment, and vehicles to help you achieve victory in combat. Play <strong>solo</strong> or <strong>team-based</strong> game modes with other players online, or play local games against bots to hone your skills.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CO-OP SURVIVAL</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/8b5d4d8b6b31205f724723a02897c74c.avif?t=1773980087\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play one of many Survival modes</strong> and last as long as you can against endless waves of soldiers, helicopters, zombies, and other creatures. Submit your score in the worldwide leaderboards!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FULL WEAPON CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/3956cdb800de220adad48fa31692d215.avif?t=1773980087\" width=720 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Personalize over 200 weapons</strong> with optics, lasers, grips, skins, and other accessories.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >IN-GAME EDITOR</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/extras/43f82d52fa88313466e2eef66fa017f4.avif?t=1773980087\" width=720 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own maps and missions</strong> with the in-game editor and instantly play them with friends online! Share or browse creations in the Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive selection of weapons, attachments, equipment, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable characters, loadouts, and vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked matches, multiplayer clans, and custom games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game editor and mod-friendly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated multiplayer servers</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MVP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3408170/ee6ad841329c7f3a0a4137d487b321841aa03e2f.jpg"},{"name":"Stuck","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3408170/884ea756e1a437cb57893f76ee66753d0b182782.jpg"},{"name":"10 Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3408170/236ed8aa3bbd4e26849cf6cb414efb86324dcce3.jpg"},{"name":"100 Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3408170/6b9a1ea142dea90119ce2bb7e2e13304587cde50.jpg"},{"name":"1,000 Kills","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3408170/893e9f17c73248b2bea1da674c9f9c8c1e9071c6.jpg"},{"name":"10 Headshots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3408170/f22a32540e753a642da72e7123834a2565072211.jpg"},{"name":"100 Headshots","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3408170/ac11c0df1b3