aps and missions</strong> with the in-game editor and instantly play them with friends online! Share or browse creations in the Workshop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plenty of game modes and maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Massive selection of weapons, attachments, equipment, and skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully customizable characters, loadouts, and vehicles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranked matches, multiplayer clans, and custom games</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense fast-paced gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game editor and mod-friendly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dedicated multiplayer servers</p></li></ul>","developers":["Wilkin Games"],"dlc":[4017270,4088790,4017250,4017260,4017280,4505220],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408170/54cd7af2072db9596a51167be0794544dc51408f/header.jpg?t=1773980087","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92026 Wilkin Games. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408170/824076050/2af15721c3881eeca6629c0076aa286f28858f70/1758434451/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758911113","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408170/824076050/2af15721c3881eeca6629c0076aa286f28858f70/1758434451/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758911113","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3408170/824076050/2af15721c3881eeca6629c0076aa286f28858f70/1758434451/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758911113","id":257203102,"name":"Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/